# flows.ctx
- Auth: login -> jwt_token -> refresh_rotated -> access_protected_routes
- RBAC: ADMINISTRADOR (full), ENCARREGADO (ops/inspections/avulsas), INSPETOR (validations/uploads), MANTENEDOR (tasks/panes)
- Panes: aircraft -> open_pane -> assign_mantenedor -> execute -> conclude
- Vencimentos: track_pn_hours/months -> identify_due -> schedule_maintenance -> execute -> reset_counter
- Inspecoes: select_types -> generate_tasks_from_templates -> audit_open_trigrama -> execute_tasks -> audit_completion_trigrama -> conclude -> pdf_report
- Calendario: range_query -> rbac_censorship -> aggregate_inspections_dpe -> safe_utc_sorting -> render_events
- Publicacoes: acervo_tree_explorer -> fts5_bm25_search -> pdf_viewer_canvas / upload_zip -> presigned_multipart -> worker_publicar -> single_flight_lock -> activate_edition
- Image_Pipeline: upload -> validate -> convert_webp -> resize -> optimize -> store_r2/local
